## Drop-off and pick-up

kpi Lane opens | 07:45
kpi Bell | 08:15
kpi Pick up by | 15:45

- **No left turns** out of the lot onto Alder Street.
- Please use the **east lot** for pick-up.

!! Students not picked up by 15:45 go to the after-school office, which charges $5 per 15 minutes.

